<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" sizes="any" href="/static/img/antarctica/favicon.svg?v=1"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Reserve your spot · Antarctica</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica.css?v=bitcoin-only-20261023"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica-checkout.css?v=payment-methods-1"><script src="/static/js/antarctica-checkout.js?v=flexible-plan-20261024" defer></script></head>
<body class="antarctica expedition-checkout">
{{ if not .CheckoutEnabled }}<div class="draft-banner">Checkout demonstration · No bookings or payments are submitted</div>{{ end }}
<header><a class="wordmark" href="/antarctica" aria-label="bitcoin++">bitcoin<span>++</span></a><span class="edition">COLD STORAGE EDITION / JAN 24–FEB 5, 2028</span><a href="/antarctica">Back to the expedition</a></header>
<main class="checkout-shell">
{{ if eq .RemainingBerths 0 }}<section aria-labelledby="sold-out-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Cold Storage Edition</p><h1 id="sold-out-heading">All spots are currently taken.</h1><p>Every berth is booked or temporarily held. Join the waitlist and we’ll email you once when spots become available.</p><a class="button" href="/expeditions/antarctica/waitlist">Join the waitlist →</a></section>{{ else }}
<nav aria-label="Checkout progress"><ol class="checkout-progress"><li aria-current="step">1 · Spots</li><li>2 · Berths</li><li {{ if .CheckoutEnabled }}hidden{{ end }}>3 · Merch</li><li>{{ if .CheckoutEnabled }}3{{ else }}4{{ end }} · Payment</li></ol></nav>
<form id="expedition-checkout" novalidate data-live="{{ .CheckoutEnabled }}" data-beta="{{ .BetaTrial }}" data-installment-dates="{{ .InstallmentDatesJSON }}" data-csrf="{{ .CSRF }}" data-request-key="{{ .RequestKey }}">
{{ if .BetaTrial }}<p class="checkout-preview-note"><strong>Private beta purchase: one berth, paid in full. $0.01 with Bitcoin or $0.50 by card.</strong> This offer is limited to your verified account, with one active test booking at a time. Cancel your test booking before starting another.</p>{{ end }}
<section data-step="0" aria-labelledby="spots-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your expedition starts here</p><h1 id="spots-heading" tabindex="-1">How many spots?</h1><p id="spots-remaining" class="spots-remaining"><strong>{{ if gt .RemainingBerths 0 }}Only {{ .RemainingBerths }} {{ if eq .RemainingBerths 1 }}spot{{ else }}spots{{ end }} remaining!{{ else }}No spots remaining.{{ end }}</strong></p><p>Start with everyone in your group. You’ll arrange their berths next.</p><div id="spot-options" class="spot-options" role="group" aria-label="Number of spots to reserve"></div><div id="custom-party-size" hidden><label for="party-size">Number of spots to reserve (6–{{ .RemainingBerths }})</label><input id="party-size" type="number" min="1" max="{{ .RemainingBerths }}" value="1" step="1" inputmode="numeric" required></div></section>
<section data-step="1" hidden aria-labelledby="berths-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Make room for your group</p><h1 id="berths-heading" tabindex="-1">Choose your berths.</h1><p>Choose a cabin type, then how many people from your group will share it. Add another cabin to split your group across rooms.</p><div class="berth-toolbar"><div aria-live="polite"><strong id="allocation-count"></strong><div id="allocation-people" class="allocation-people" aria-hidden="true"></div><p id="allocation-help"></p></div><button type="button" id="add-cabin" class="checkout-secondary">+ Add cabin</button></div><div id="cabin-undo" class="cabin-undo" hidden><span role="status">Cabin removed.</span><button type="button" id="undo-cabin">Undo</button></div><div id="cabin-allocations"></div><p>For unfilled twin cabins, request an M, F or co-ed roommate arrangement. Triple and quad cabins default to co-ed. We’ll try to match your preference, but cannot guarantee it. Cabin numbers and deck locations are not guaranteed.</p><details class="ship-layout-reference"><summary>Explore the ship layout</summary><p>Reference only. This diagram includes cabins outside our allocation and does not show bookable cabin numbers.</p><a href="/static/img/antarctica/berths.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img src="/static/img/antarctica/berths.png" alt="Reference layout of decks 3 and 4, not available cabin inventory" width="929" height="509" loading="lazy"></a></details></section>
<section data-step="2" hidden aria-labelledby="merch-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A little extra for the journey</p><h1 id="merch-heading" tabindex="-1">Make it yours.</h1>{{ if .MerchSnapshot }}<p class="fine">Sample catalog: public-shop hat prices checked October 22, 2026. Quantities are illustrative, not live stock.</p>{{ end }}
{{ range .Merch }}<article class="checkout-merch">{{ if .Image }}<img src="{{ .Image }}" alt="{{ .Name }}" width="240" height="240">{{ end }}<div><h2>{{ .Name }}</h2>{{ if .Variant }}<p>{{ .Variant }}</p>{{ end }}<p>{{ .Price }} USD each</p><div class="merch-purchase"><div><label for="merch-{{ .ID }}">Quantity</label><div class="quantity-stepper"><button type="button" data-quantity-change="-1" aria-label="Remove one {{ .Name }}{{ if .Variant }} · {{ .Variant }}{{ end }}">−</button><input type="number" id="merch-{{ .ID }}" class="merch-quantity" data-name="{{ .Name }}" data-variant="{{ .Variant }}" data-price="{{ .Cents }}" min="0" max="{{ .Max }}" step="1" value="0" inputmode="numeric" required><button type="button" data-quantity-change="1" aria-label="Add one {{ .Name }}{{ if .Variant }} · {{ .Variant }}{{ end }}">+</button></div></div><div class="merch-line-total"><span>Item total</span><strong data-merch-line-total>$0.00</strong></div></div></div></article>{{ else }}<p>No hats are available from the catalog right now. You can continue without merch.</p>{{ end }}
<div class="merch-total-bar" aria-live="polite"><div><span>Merch subtotal</span><small id="merch-count">No items added</small></div><strong id="merch-subtotal">$0.00</strong></div><p class="fine">Merch is separate from your passage fare and is not eligible for the 5% passage discount. Hats are picked up onboard, with no shipping charge or shipping address required. Any applicable merchandise tax is still being determined.</p></section>
<section data-step="3" hidden aria-labelledby="payment-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Your passage south</p><h1 id="payment-heading" tabindex="-1">Review &amp; payment.</h1><div id="booking-summary"></div><fieldset class="payment-methods"><legend>Payment plan</legend><div class="payment-method-options"><label class="payment-method-option"><input type="radio" name="plan" value="installments" {{ if .InstallmentsAvailable }}checked{{ else }}disabled{{ end }}><span><strong>{{ if .InstallmentsAvailable }}{{ .PaymentCount }} equal payments{{ else }}Installments unavailable{{ end }}</strong><small>{{ if .InstallmentsAvailable }}Signup and remaining scheduled dates{{ else }}The final payment date has arrived{{ end }}</small></span></label><label class="payment-method-option"><input type="radio" name="plan" value="full" {{ if not .InstallmentsAvailable }}checked{{ end }}><span><strong>Pay in full</strong><small>Your entire passage fare today</small></span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="payment-methods"><legend>Payment method</legend><div class="payment-method-options"><label class="payment-method-option"><input type="radio" name="provider" value="opennode" checked><span><strong>Bitcoin</strong><small>{{ if .BetaTrial }}Private beta fare: $0.01{{ else }}Lightning or on-chain{{ end }}</small></span></label>{{ if .StripeEnabled }}<label class="payment-method-option"><input type="radio" name="provider" value="stripe"><span><strong>Card via Stripe</strong><small>{{ if .BetaTrial }}Private beta fare: $0.50{{ else }}Pay securely in USD{{ end }}</small></span></label>{{ end }}</div></fieldset>{{ if .BetaTrial }}<p>Your private beta fare is $0.01 with Bitcoin or $0.50 by card (Stripe’s minimum). One berth, paid in full. No installments or additional fare balance.</p>{{ else }}<p>Save 5% on passage only when paying in full with bitcoin. Installment payments use the standard fare.</p>{{ end }}<div id="checkout-totals" aria-live="polite"></div><section class="booking-terms" aria-labelledby="booking-terms-heading"><h2 id="booking-terms-heading">Booking terms</h2><p><a href="/expeditions/antarctica/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read booking terms and privacy information ↗</a></p>
{{ if .Policy }}<input type="hidden" name="terms_version" value="{{ .Policy.Version }}"><label class="checkout-check"><input type="checkbox" id="booking-terms-accepted" name="terms_accepted" value="yes" required><span>I agree to the expedition booking terms, including the cancellation policy and payment schedule, and acknowledge the privacy policy.</span></label><p class="fine">Policy version {{ .Policy.Version }} · Effective {{ .Policy.EffectiveAt.UTC.Format "January 2, 2006" }}. Acceptance will be recorded when your purchase is submitted.</p>{{ else }}<p class="fine">Booking information updated {{ .TermsUpdated }}. Review the cancellation policy, including the non-refundable 20% deposit, the October 1, 2027 refund cutoff and USD valuation of Bitcoin payments.</p>{{ end }}</section>
{{ if .CheckoutEnabled }}<p>Need a company invoice? You can add billing details after payment.</p><p>Your berths are confirmed after payment is verified. Remaining installments are paid separately on their scheduled dates.</p><button type="submit" id="checkout-pay" class="button">Continue to payment →</button>{{ else }}<p>This demonstration does not collect traveler details or payments.</p><button type="button" class="button" disabled>Payment unavailable in this demonstration</button>{{ end }}{{ if .Preview }}<p><a href="?booking=1">View a sample booking and payment schedule →</a></p>{{ end }}</section>
<p id="checkout-error" role="alert"></p><div class="checkout-actions"><button type="button" id="checkout-back" class="checkout-secondary" hidden>Back</button><button type="submit" id="checkout-next" class="button">Choose berths →</button></div>
</form><noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to reserve your passage.</p></noscript>
<div id="checkout-fares" hidden>{{ range .Berths }}<span data-berth="{{ .ID }}" data-price="{{ .PriceCents }}" data-name="{{ .Name }}"></span>{{ end }}</div>
{{ end }}</main></body></html>
